<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela Manpa 1996 net up 49 pct.</title>
<headline>Venezuela Manpa 1996 net up 49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		    1995</p>
<p>    Net		 12.248 bln bolivars	 8.209 bln</p>
<p>    Sales	     97.101 bln bolviars     114.317 bln</p>
<p>    Cost of sales   71.229 bln bolivars	87.753 bln</p>
<p>    Operating costs 15.729 bln bolivars	14.352 bln</p>
<p>NOTES: All results are preliminary and inflation-adjusted in constant December 31, 1996, bolivars.</p>
<p>Manufacturas de Papel C.A. (Manpa) is a pulp and paper manufacturer.</p>
<p>((--Caracas Newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
